<title>JAPAN: Nomura Securities lists stocks in model portfolio.</title>
<headline>Nomura Securities lists stocks in model portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Wednesday that the following was a list of stocks in its model portfolio, which the brokerage expects to outperform the Nikkei 225 average or the TOPIX index between October and December:</p>
<p>Nippon Denwa Shisetsu Co Ltd</p>
<p>Shin-Etsu Chemical Co Ltd</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Gas Chemical Co Ltd</p>
<p>Kawasaki Steel Corp</p>
<p>SMC Corp</p>
<p>Hitachi Ltd</p>
<p>TDK Corp</p>
<p>Alps Electric Co Ltd</p>
<p>Pioneer Electronic Corp</p>
<p>Denso Corp</p>
<p>Rohm Co Ltd</p>
<p>Nitto Denko Corp</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd</p>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>F-Tech Inc</p>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>Kojima Co Ltd</p>
<p>Canon Inc</p>
<p>Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd</p>
<p>Tokyo Style Co Ltd</p>
<p>Jusco Co Ltd</p>
<p>Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd</p>
<p>Shohkoh Fund &amp; Co Ltd</p>
<p>Mitsui Fudosan Co Ltd</p>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp</p>
</text>
